# SQL Schema

- MVP tables: users, trust_scores, reports, report_images, ai_tags, image_vaults, matches, claim_attempts, verification_sessions, chat_rooms, chat_messages, notifications, audit_logs.
- Enable PostGIS + pgvector; spatial indexes for nearby queries.
- RLS-friendly design for Supabase; vault metadata never in public-readable views.
- Migrations additive and reversible when possible; no dropping vault data casually.
- Embeddings: 1536-d vectors for `text-embedding-3-small`.
